Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.52,0:00:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream, one wish. If you want it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.04,0:00:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,gotta go over the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Setting sail and heading for the unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.32,0:00:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Cutting through the\Nwinds and waves as I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep it up, never stopping, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.52,0:00:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause I'm aiming to get there first, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.92,0:00:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all or nothing. No time to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.50,0:00:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it later, right now I'm living free.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.48,0:00:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,When your foes look like\Nthey will overwhelm you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.54,0:00:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It means your heart's saying\Nthis is what you can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.30,0:00:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite all that to run is not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.64,0:01:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Once they're closed, I\Nfeel the satisfaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.72,0:01:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm rude,\Nhere's my appreciation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.02,0:01:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,When things are getting\Ntough, just gotta smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.90,0:01:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are going on your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.40,0:01:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're looking for\Na fresh, brand new day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.66,0:01:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Then make sure your only\Nthought you have is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.80,0:01:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.96,0:01:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,As you're on your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.16,0:01:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Mark maps will be made.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.42,0:01:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, with every step that you will take.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.26,0:01:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at all you've been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.48,0:01:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Look ahead at new horizons.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.22,0:01:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,In view shining brightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.08,0:01:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, who knows what's waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.78,0:01:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Dream living, that's the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.20,0:01:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Make like a hurricane.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.22,0:01:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, got to make your mark today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.06,0:01:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream, one wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.08,0:01:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dreams don't run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.08,0:01:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Go for the knockout.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.06,0:01:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Over the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.72,0:02:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, she's waking up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.20,0:02:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Big Bro in the Utsuru!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.32,0:02:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.74,0:02:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my tea house.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.16,0:02:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Otama.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.82,0:02:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.06,0:02:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Is your stomach feeling all better now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.14,0:02:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong? Does it still hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.76,0:02:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No more tummy ache! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.38,0:02:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,One little sip and that's all it takes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.30,0:02:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,As they say, the evil purging\Nherb is a miracle drug.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.96,0:02:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Takes a bunch, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.06,0:02:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Nii-niii!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.97,0:02:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Nii-niii! Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.88,0:03:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the medicine can't remove\Nall of the poison in your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.72,0:03:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So you must not drink\Nthe river water again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.74,0:03:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you promise me that? Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.54,0:03:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I learned my lesson good!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.36,0:03:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Abore your shape!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.00,0:03:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Quiet tummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.84,0:03:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I need water!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.10,0:03:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oden, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.78,0:03:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.24,0:03:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The water, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.84,0:03:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The river water!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.96,0:03:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not drink it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.98,0:03:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There, that should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.06,0:03:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only a field dressing, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.64,0:03:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.62,0:03:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a ton. Damn you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.98,0:03:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,a sizable woman I don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.62,0:04:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,compared to big mom she looks\Npretty tiny I should have said
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.92,0:04:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,thank you for saving me earlier\Nfrom that sumo wrestlers
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.16,0:04:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,advances I didn't do anything
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.88,0:04:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,but look at him I suppose I
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.36,0:04:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,introduce myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.58,0:04:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.16,0:04:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Okiku.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.98,0:04:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,My name?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.74,0:04:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't! No! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.74,0:04:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't! I shouldn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.46,0:04:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it away! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.74,0:04:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.65,0:04:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even have money to pay\Nfor the medicine you gave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.52,0:04:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't afford a yummy dessert like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.90,0:05:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Who said you had to pay? It's a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.36,0:05:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.27,0:05:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That wouldn't be right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.62,0:05:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You and Okiku need to eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.80,0:05:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're as hungry as me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.60,0:05:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,All is well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.66,0:05:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You needn't be shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.58,0:05:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But ma 'am, you already saved my life\Nand now you're offering me food? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.90,0:05:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's more than I deserve!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.70,0:05:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take it. Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.96,0:05:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.46,0:05:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't take the food and I'll\Npay you back for the medicine too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.56,0:05:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough, out of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.46,0:05:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you think this\Nwas going to play out?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.12,0:05:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.88,0:05:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's fine, you little imp.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.62,0:05:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you take me for?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.88,0:05:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't want to eat it, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.04,0:05:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how about I go dump\Nit on the side of the road?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.94,0:06:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.34,0:06:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Otama, please, just eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.94,0:06:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Otsuru will never back\Ndown from a challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.34,0:06:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just gonna stare at it all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.62,0:06:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Lighten up a little, come on, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.62,0:06:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Supposed to be your birthday?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.84,0:06:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.58,0:06:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.16,0:06:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,At least good then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.08,0:06:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You can consider that a birthday\Npresent from me, so eat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.98,0:07:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.34,0:07:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.50,0:07:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no idea that food\Ncould taste so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.16,0:07:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.07,0:07:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean you've never\Nhad this stuff before?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.02,0:07:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.64,0:07:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know how many days it's been\Nsince she's had even a bite to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.36,0:07:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That poor girl weaves\Nhats day in and day out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.70,0:07:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And if she's lucky, she'll\Nsell the whole batch,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.56,0:08:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,earning her just enough money to\Nbarely get by and feed herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.42,0:08:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's even got little mochi balls in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.64,0:08:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the feast of a lifetime!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.94,0:08:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you pull those out of your\Ncheek whenever you want, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.88,0:08:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but you can't fill your\Ntummy with the ones I make.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.54,0:08:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.44,0:08:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.64,0:08:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for being so kind to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.50,0:08:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never had such a great birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.66,0:08:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think I can top it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.34,0:08:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A shame that Master isn't\Nhere to share this with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.24,0:08:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Otsuru...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.04,0:09:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the greatest day of my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.74,0:09:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There are children like\Nher all over this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.90,0:09:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the state of things here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.44,0:09:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That isn't right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.98,0:09:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That poor little kid. Always hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.10,0:09:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, grown-ups are okay\Nbecause we can eat poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.32,0:09:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.62,0:09:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got the sea, rivers,\Nand forests, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.42,0:09:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no reason people\Nshould be starving around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.26,0:09:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.08,0:09:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If only we hadn't destroyed our own land.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.22,0:09:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.10,0:10:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.56,0:10:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You two are such kind-hearted\Nyoung men, by the way, what are
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.70,0:10:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,your names you can call me Zoro
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.60,0:10:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Judo, I'm a ronin. Right, I'm Monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.56,0:10:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,His name is, uh, Luffy Taro.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.36,0:10:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.27,0:10:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.68,0:10:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Luffy Taro.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.56,0:10:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Honorably.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.02,0:10:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're from overseas.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.46,0:10:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised that you could make it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.02,0:10:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What gave us away?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.62,0:11:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I hardly know where to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.78,0:11:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.06,0:11:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let your secret out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.94,0:11:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't lived in this\Ntown that long myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.16,0:11:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And Okiku has only been working\Nat my tea house for a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.36,0:11:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard the name of this\Ntown means leftovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.90,0:11:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the deal with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.04,0:11:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like the name implies.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.20,0:11:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The people here survive on scraps,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.88,0:11:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,specifically from the town where\Nthe government officials live.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.60,0:11:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Thomas said not all the food here is\Npoisonous, so where's the good stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.92,0:11:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Look over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.30,0:11:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you see that tall\Nmountain in the middle?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.84,0:11:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Lush with foliage and without chimneys?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.44,0:11:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,At its peak, there was once\Na place known as Odin Castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.94,0:11:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe so much\Ntime has gone by already.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.66,0:11:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Odin, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.84,0:11:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.44,0:11:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.50,0:11:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Until some 20 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.80,0:12:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,there was a group called\Nthe Kozuki clan who had
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.12,0:12:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,governed this land of\NWano for a very long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.44,0:12:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That vast farm that sits at\Nthe base of the mountain was
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.44,0:12:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,constructed by the late Lord Odin\Nwhen he watched over this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.08,0:12:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,His intent was to provide fresh,\Nhealthy food to everyone in Kuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.28,0:12:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You see how that's turned out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.82,0:12:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Orochi and his associates\Nhold everything under their thumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.90,0:12:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The Paradise Farm is beyond our reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.84,0:12:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.02,0:12:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That food is safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.98,0:12:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Not like the poison stuff here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.52,0:12:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.36,0:13:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a bounty of crops and fresh\Nwater, clothing, resources, and more.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.40,0:13:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But we can't so much as gaze upon them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.64,0:13:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.02,0:13:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,They belong to the Shogun Orochi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.68,0:13:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,On the other side of the Shrine Gate,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.94,0:13:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,there is a town where all\Nof the officials dwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.94,0:13:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.85,0:13:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,the people here live off\Nthe scraps that they toss
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.54,0:13:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,away and the nearly rotting\Nfood that they sell to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.20,0:13:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's why it's called leftovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.32,0:13:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Okobore, but at least we can live.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.60,0:13:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.84,0:13:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,oh, oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.14,0:14:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.42,0:14:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You better stay out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.96,0:14:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard what you said, woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.90,0:14:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You were speaking ill\Nof the Shogun just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.90,0:14:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I can hear six times better\Nthan humans like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.58,0:14:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So if anyone trash talks\Nto Shogun, I'll know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.36,0:14:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Regardless of what you might have heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.12,0:14:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no excuse to take\Nsomeone's life in cold blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.38,0:14:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,She would have died if that hit her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.92,0:14:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If people keep their mouths\Nshut then I won't have
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.78,0:14:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,to shoot them probably\Nbut if you want to rebel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.70,0:15:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's one thing Lord Orochi\Nwon't stand for no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.42,0:15:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.36,0:15:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're making me waste all my arrows!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.60,0:15:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.58,0:15:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,For a couple of weeks now, there\Nhave been robberies at the farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.82,0:15:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been looking everywhere for\Nthe criminals without much luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.84,0:15:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.22,0:15:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the bandits, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.44,0:16:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,A one-eyed ronin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.88,0:16:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the jerk I saw\Non that Wanted poster.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.06,0:16:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.54,0:16:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.98,0:16:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.88,0:16:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your deal, weirdo?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.10,0:16:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you taking her?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.46,0:16:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone help!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.86,0:16:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.96,0:16:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Taba!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.52,0:16:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Taba!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.70,0:16:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Mission accomplished!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.58,0:16:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.80,0:17:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Kiku!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.96,0:17:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.12,0:17:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He truly is fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.48,0:17:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I said let's dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.14,0:17:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.64,0:17:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't give a crap! Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.78,0:17:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Lionbog, come aid me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.10,0:17:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.20,0:17:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Doggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.12,0:17:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That lady has a fancy sword on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.62,0:17:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,She did mention that she\Nknows how to use one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.20,0:17:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I've never seen her fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.96,0:18:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey doggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.56,0:18:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I need a ride too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.46,0:18:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.76,0:18:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.56,0:18:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.60,0:18:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.80,0:18:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.22,0:18:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Lusitaro, thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.72,0:18:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You broke Zoro Judo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.66,0:18:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck do they want\Nfrom that kid, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.56,0:18:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not certain, but we had\Nbetter save her quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.86,0:18:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.28,0:18:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.68,0:18:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming for you, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.94,0:18:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.92,0:18:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I got this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.02,0:18:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.40,0:18:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.74,0:19:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So long, losers!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.20,0:19:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They pulled that off too easily;
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.96,0:19:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,they must have been planning this by\Norder of a headliner, no doubt though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.58,0:19:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I know not why, sadly, there's only\None destination in that direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.22,0:19:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,They're headed to the town of officials.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.84,0:19:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.75,0:19:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,There are three headliners\Nthat dwell in that town,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.76,0:19:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,hawkins hold 'em and speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.28,0:19:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.19,0:19:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.32,0:19:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There are also about 30\Nsoldiers who acquired
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.30,0:19:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,special abilities from\Nstrange artificial fruits.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.00,0:19:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.48,0:19:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're more than just a\Nnormal waitress, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.52,0:19:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Start talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.84,0:20:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hearken well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.46,0:20:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.64,0:20:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Master Hold 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.44,0:20:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Gazelle Man here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.06,0:20:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I caught that little brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.36,0:20:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.30,0:20:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The one who tamed the\Nbaboon off by the shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.70,0:20:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone help me, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.00,0:20:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.16,0:20:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll put her to good use.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.14,0:20:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring her to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.04,0:20:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.48,0:20:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Crow, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.08,0:20:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.44,0:20:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,In Kuri,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.86,0:21:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,there lies a place known as Bacala Town,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.88,0:21:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,where pirates and officials\Nflourish while others starve.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.46,0:21:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That damn rodent!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.98,0:21:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Who does he think he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.56,0:21:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The powerful aura of his\Ngave me pause for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.06,0:21:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm not giving up on Okiku.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.60,0:21:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,She will be my bride someday, Pin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.20,0:21:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got status, I've got fame, and\NI've got a safe supply of food to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.88,0:21:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Who could possibly reject\Na man like me, Patty?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.82,0:21:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta stop sweating the\Nsmall stuff, you dumb lug.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.56,0:21:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That gal you fancy's from Okobore Town.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.88,0:21:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They're so low-class that Lord Orochi won't\Neven accept them as servants, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.02,0:22:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Choo-choo-choo-choo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.08,0:22:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You're getting hung up on her\Nfeelings when they don't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.48,0:22:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You can just force her to marry you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.64,0:22:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Burn her house down so\Nshe has nowhere to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.24,0:22:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill her family so she\Nhas no one to turn to.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.14,0:22:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Make her completely dependent on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.80,0:22:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,When she's starving with\Nnothing left in the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.92,0:22:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,she'll change her tune real fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.40,0:22:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Choo, choo, choo, choo, choo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.04,0:22:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You belong to the warrior class.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.52,0:22:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That distinction means everything in the\Nland of Wano, so don't be a pushover.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.54,0:22:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.52,0:22:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the star of our national sport,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.12,0:22:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,but you're bowing down\Nto the whims of a winch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.78,0:22:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Show some pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.42,0:22:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It sets a bad example.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.48,0:22:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a fine point.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.58,0:22:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.82,0:22:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do whatever I want with Okiku.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.30,0:23:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.78,0:23:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Was the food not to your liking, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.28,0:23:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a raccoon dog there?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.38,0:23:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's our pet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.48,0:23:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We raised it ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.54,0:23:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you cook it up for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.46,0:23:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Raccoon dog is my favorite food.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.16,0:23:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finally here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.82,0:24:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep going straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.64,0:24:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll charge through the front.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.40,0:24:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Lifitaro, Zorojuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.22,0:24:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.14,0:24:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond that gate is Bekori town.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.54,0:24:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Where officials and pirates reign.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.48,0:24:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We enter at our own peril.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.62,0:24:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now steal thine hearts. You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.48,0:24:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Always.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.70,0:24:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a tiny little thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.66,0:24:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost pity you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.30,0:24:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and cry if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.74,0:24:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna cry, you Moon!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.66,0:24:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.76,0:25:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You trying to act tough?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.20,0:25:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.50,0:25:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a stitch in my side!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.66,0:25:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.80,0:25:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.62,0:25:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Get outta here! Link!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.44,0:25:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.96,0:25:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Go huff 'n puff somewhere else, would ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.04,0:25:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to be a runner, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.22,0:25:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Work on your stamina.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.04,0:26:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You moron, I wasn't talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.48,0:26:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What don't give me that look?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.74,0:26:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.86,0:26:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does he have a lie in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.58,0:26:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.24,0:26:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't learned your lesson yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.54,0:27:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What did he just do?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.64,0:27:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Savage.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.55,0:27:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That lion always goes\Nstraight for the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.04,0:27:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.44,0:27:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Since they share the same body,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.42,0:27:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,it's like the lion is hitting\Nitself in the balls, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.08,0:27:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's poetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.28,0:27:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you would learn so this\Ngirl here, what should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.94,0:27:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,with her master holden are you\Nlistening so your name's otama
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.32,0:27:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,well you're clearly weak\Nand a little coward to boot
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.38,0:27:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet you tamed that savage baboon!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.90,0:27:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.34,0:27:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My men saw it happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.20,0:28:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,it's too late to play dumb with me we know
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.86,0:28:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,it's a Devil Fruit power\Nbut how does it work
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.76,0:28:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Runt.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.76,0:28:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Spit it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.68,0:28:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Otama.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.20,0:28:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Your unique Devil Fruit ability will\Nno doubt be enticing to our enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.44,0:28:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,If you use it in front of others,\NI fear they may target you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.76,0:28:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.92,0:29:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth about me is that\NI'm real popular with animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.00,0:29:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.88,0:29:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Aww.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.06,0:29:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That is so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.40,0:29:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And here I thought you had secret powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.42,0:29:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.33,0:29:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No powers here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.00,0:29:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You take me for a fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.74,0:29:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not screwing around here!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.88,0:29:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it your cheek?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.68,0:29:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what they said.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.20,0:29:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They saw you tear off a piece of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.34,0:29:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're not gonna tell me, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.06,0:29:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.58,0:29:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.49,0:30:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring me some pliers! Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.16,0:30:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Not the little ones!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.02,0:30:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The big scary pair!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.42,0:30:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you there, Big Barrel?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.34,0:30:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me, Big Barrel!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.46,0:30:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.86,0:30:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn back, you fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.94,0:30:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Only death awaits you here!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.22,0:30:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hold back!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.92,0:30:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If we can just get past\Nthem, we'll have made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.92,0:30:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, we don't have time\Nto waste on these chumps.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.86,0:30:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Push through!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.18,0:30:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Feed me to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.10,0:31:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, dog! Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.28,0:31:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.88,0:31:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There's an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.56,0:31:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Do something—you're gonna have to\Nexplain the problem to me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.08,0:31:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.76,0:31:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat finally made it to\Nwanna—that's good—what's the issue?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.66,0:31:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the issue? He and Roronoa are\Ncharging straight into Baccona Town,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.70,0:31:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,ready for a fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.34,0:31:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Bunch of fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.94,0:31:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,They're going to ruin the whole damn plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.36,0:31:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So it would appear.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.70,0:31:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.58,0:31:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.26,0:31:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, stop them, and make it quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.66,0:31:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.46,0:32:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want me to stop, then\Nshow me that ability of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.58,0:32:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Dome!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.08,0:32:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.99,0:32:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.64,0:32:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Dock!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.20,0:33:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Dock?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.28,0:33:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Conqueror's Haki, they call it!
